{
  "id": "ACT.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Ivyakozwe 5",
  "verseCount": 42,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko hariho umugabo yitwa Ananiya, yari afise umugore yitwa Safira. Bagurisha itongo ryabo babigiye inama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aca yumvikana n’uwo mugore wiwe, bafata igice c’amahera bakuyemwo barakinyegeza, igice kindi aba ari co bajana bagishira imbere y’ibirenge vy’intumwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Petero abaza Ananiya ati: “Ananiya, ni gute wemeye ko Satani yuzuza umutima wawe guhenda Mpwemu Yera mu kunyegeza igice c’amahera wagurishije itongo ryawe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbega utararigurisha ntiryari iryawe? Kandi umaze kurigurisha, amahera ntiyari ayawe? Vyakugendeye gute ngo wiyumvire gukora ikintu nk’ico? Erega si twebwe wabeshe, ahubwo wabeshe Imana!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ananiya acumva ivyo, agwa hasi arahwera. Abumvise ibibaye bose batekerwa n’ubwoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze abasore bari ngaho baca bava hasi, batekera ikiziga ciwe bakijana kugihamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haciye nk’amasaha atatu umugore wiwe aca arashika, atazi ivyabaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero aramubaza ati: “Mbwira! Aya ni amahera yose mwe na Ananiya mwakuye mw’itongo mwagurishije?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Safira amwishura ati: “Egome, ni ayo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero aca amubwira ati: “Vyabagendeye gute ngo mwumvikane guhenda Mpwemu w’Umwami Imana? Raba ibirenge vy’abavuye guhamba umugabo wawe bigeze aho imbere y’umuryango, kandi nawe barakujana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubwo nyene aca agwa hasi imbere y’ibirenge vya Petero, aracikana. Ba bantu baca barinjira, basanga na we arapfuye, baramufata baja kumuhamba, bamuryamika i ruhande y’umugabo wiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishengero ryose n’abumvise ivyabaye bose baca bafatwa n’ubwoba bwinshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyuma y’ivyo, intumwa zibandanya zikora ibitangaza n’utwumiza mu bantu, kandi abizera bose bama bahurira hamwe mw’ibaraza rya Salomo, bahuje umutima n’inama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nta n’umwe yubahuka kwifatanya na bo, n’aho abantu babemera cane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko abantu benshi, abagabo n’abagore barizera Umwami, igitigiri cabo cama congerekana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vyatuma kandi abantu benshi bama bazana abagwaye bakabaryamika mu nderuzo no ku birago i ruhande y’inzira, kugira ngo Petero arenganye igitutu ciwe gipfume kibashikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu isinzi bama bakorana bavuye mu mihana ikikuje Yerusalemu, bazanye abagwaye n’abafashwe n’impwemu mbi, kandi bose barakira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze umuherezi mukuru n’abo bari bafadikanije, bari mu muce b’Abasadukayo, babagirira ishari ryinshi intumwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko barabafata babashira mw’ibohero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko mw’ijoro, umumarayika w’Umwami Imana yugurura imiryango y’iryo bohero, arabasohora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze arababwira ati: “Nimugende muhagarare mu rusengero, mubwire abantu ubutumwa bwuzuye bw’ivy’ubu bugingo bushasha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye binjira mu rusengero nk’uko babariwe, batangura kwigisha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuherezi mukuru n’abo bari bafatanije bashitse, baca bakoranya inama nkuru y’abarongoye ubwoko bw’Abisirayeli, bahejeje barungika abarinzi b’urusengero kw’ibohero kuzana za ntumwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko abo barinzi b’urusengero bashitse kw’ibohero, ntibabasangayo, baca basubira inyuma gutanga inkuru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bavuga bati: “Twasanze ibohero ryugaye neza, n’abarinzi bahagaze ku miryango, ariko twuguruye twasanze ata muntu n’umwe yariyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umukuru w’abarinzi b’urusengero n’abaherezi bakurubakuru bavyumvise barazazanirwa cane bibaza ibishobora gukurikira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubwo nyene haca haza umuntu, ababwira ati: “Ba bagabo mwashira mw’ibohero, bahagaze mu rusengero bariko barigisha abantu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa mukuru w’abarinzi b’urusengero aca ajana n’abarinzi bari kumwe, baja kuzana izo ntumwa. Ariko babazana ku neza badakoresheje inguvu, kuko batinya ko abantu bobatera amabuye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babashikanye, babashira imbere y’inama nkuru y’abarongoye ubwo bwoko, maze umuherezi mukuru atangura kubasambisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arababwira ati: “Twari twabihanikirije kutongera kwigisha muri iryo zina. Ariko mwakwiragije inyigisho zanyu i Yerusalemu hose, kandi mwamaramaje kutwegekako amaraso y’uwo muntu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero n’izindi ntumwa barishura bati: “Dutegerezwa kwubaha Imana kuruta abantu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imana ya ba sogokuruza yazuye Yesu mu bapfuye, uwo mwari mwishe mumubamvye ku musaraba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imana yaramushize hejuru imwicarika i buryo bwayo nk’Umutware n’Umukiza, kugira ngo ahe Abisirayeli ukwihana n’uguharirwa ivyaha vyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo twebwe turabishingira intahe, kandi na Mpwemu Yera arabishingira intahe, uwo Imana yahaye abamwumvira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bavyumvise barashangashirwa, bagomba kubicisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko hari Umufarisayo yitwa Gamaliyeli, yari umwigisha w’ivyagezwe, yubahwa cane n’abantu bose. Arahaguruka, asaba ko bataramura gatoya izo ntumwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aca abwira abagize inama nkuru y’Abayuda ati: “Bagabo bo muri Isirayeli, mwiyumvire neza ku vyo mugomba kugirira aba bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu misi iheze, uwitwa Teyuda yaje yigira uwuhambaye, abantu bashika amajana ane baramukurikira. Amaze kwicwa, abamukurikira bose baciye basanzara, ntibagira ico bashikako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyuma yaho, Yuda Umunyagalilaya yaje mu misi yo gusansuma abantu, arongoye umugwi w’abantu bagumutse. Na we nyene yarishwe, abamukurikira barasanzara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero ku bw’aba bantu na bo, ndabahanure: Nimurekure aba bantu bigire! Kuko nimba ivyo bariko barakora vyavuye ku bantu, nta ho bizoshika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko nimba biva ku Mana, ntimuzoshobora kubagwanya; ahubwo muzosanga muriko mugwanya Imana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko bemera impanuro ziwe, bahamagaza za ntumwa, barazikubitisha, bazitegeka kudasubira kwigisha muri iryo zina rya Yesu, baca barabarekura barataha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izo ntumwa zica ziva imbere y’Inama Nkuru y’abarongoye ubwo bwoko zinezerewe, kuko Imana yari yabonye ko bibabereye kubabazwa bahorwa izina rya Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imisi yose bama mu rusengero canke mu mihana, ntibigeze bahagarika kwigisha no kwamamaza inkuru nziza, bavuga ko Yesu ari we Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
